Section 1. ESTABLISHMENT OF COMPANY.

         The parties  hereto hereby enter into this  Agreement and do hereby set
forth the terms of the Company  established under and pursuant to the provisions
of the Delaware Act, which terms shall govern the rights and  liabilities of the
Members, except as otherwise herein expressly stated.

Section 2. NAME, PRINCIPAL OFFICE AND ADDRESS.

