vessels,  towboats and barges and offshore  energy  exploration  and  production
equipment   that  may   characterized   as  vessels);   (b)  machine  tools  and
manufacturing  equipment such as computer- and  mechanically-controlled  lathes,
drill presses,  vertical and horizontal milling machines, rotary and cylindrical
grinders,  metal  fabrication  and slitting  equipment,  and other metal forming
equipment,  and entire  facilities  dedicated to  manufacturing,  production  or
distribution of goods; (c) materials  handling  equipment such as fork-lifts and
more specialized  equipment for moving materials in warehouse or shipping areas;
(d)  furniture  and  fixtures,   store   fixtures,   display  cases,   freezers,
