Member) may request that the Company redeem, and, subject to the availability of
funds in  accordance  with  clause  (b) below and the other  provisions  of this
Section 10.5 and  provided  that the Company  shall not, in any  calendar  year,
redeem Company Interests that, in the aggregate, along with all Shares otherwise
