Section 13. MEETINGS AND VOTING RIGHTS OF THE MEMBERS.

     13.1     Meetings of the Members.

         (a) A meeting of the  Members  may be called by the  Manager on its own
initiative,  and shall be called by the Manager following its receipt of written
request(s)  for a  meeting  from  Members  holding  10%  or  more  of  the  then

